{
  "label": "Bulk Assign",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk Assign Management",
      "id": "bulk-assign",
      "intro": "Bulk Assign memungkinkan supervisor untuk assign multiple alerts ke investigator secara sekaligus. Fitur ini mempercepat distribusi workload dan memastikan alerts ditangani dengan cepat.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu Bulk Assign?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Assign multiple alerts sekaligus ke satu investigator\n• Hanya bisa assign alerts yang belum ter-assign\n• Alerts yang sudah classified atau locked tidak bisa di-assign\n• Support batch processing dengan feedback per alert\n• Track assignment history untuk audit trail",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2M8.5 3a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8zM20 8v6M23 11h-6\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Bulk Assign</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Assign Multiple Alerts</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ UNASSIGNED</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">✕ LOCKED</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">✕ CLASSIFIED</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Aktivasi Bulk Assign Mode",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik button **Actions** atau **More Actions** di toolbar\n• Pilih **Bulk Assign** dari menu dropdown\n• Sistem akan filter dan hanya tampilkan alerts yang:\n  - Belum ter-assign (assignedTo = null)\n  - Belum classified\n  - Tidak dalam status locked\n• Halaman akan switch ke selection mode",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Actions</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:4px;cursor:pointer;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2M8.5 3a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8zM20 8v6M23 11h-6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Assign</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:4px;cursor:pointer;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M13 5a4 4 0 010 7.75M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75M21 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Reassign</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;cursor:pointer;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk History</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Select Alerts untuk Assign",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Centang checkbox pada alerts yang ingin di-assign\n• Alert counter akan update real-time di toolbar\n• Bisa select multiple alerts sekaligus\n• Hanya alerts yang eligible yang bisa dicentang\n• Alert yang sudah di-bulk classify sebelumnya tidak bisa di-select (ditandai dengan border dashed hijau)",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background:linear-gradient(to right,#eef2ff,#f5f3ff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">ASSIGN MODE</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Select alerts to assign</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">3 Selected</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12345 • Suspicious Transaction</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12346 • High Risk Account</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12347 • Multiple Declined</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Submit Bulk Assignment",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik button **Assign Selected (X)** di toolbar\n• Dialog akan muncul dengan list alerts yang dipilih\n• Pilih investigator dari dropdown\n  - List investigator diambil dari user dengan role investigator\n  - Bisa search investigator by name\n• Klik **Submit** untuk proses assignment\n• Sistem akan:\n  - Process assignment per alert\n  - Show success/failed count\n  - Display failed alert IDs jika ada\n• Auto refresh list setelah submit",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Assign - 3 Alerts</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#8b5cf6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Submit</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Assign To</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\"><option>John Analyst</option><option>Sarah Investigator</option><option>Mike Fraud Detector</option></select></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selected Alerts (3)</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\">• Alert #12345 - Suspicious Transaction</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\">• Alert #12346 - High Risk Account</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\">• Alert #12347 - Multiple Declined</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Single Alert Assignment",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Bisa juga assign single alert tanpa bulk mode\n• Buka alert detail\n• Klik button **Assign** di header atau action menu\n• Dialog assign akan muncul khusus untuk 1 alert tersebut\n• Pilih investigator dan submit\n• Alert akan langsung ter-assign dan di-refresh",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdf4;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Assign Alert #12345</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Assign</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Alert Details</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>Case ID:</strong> #12345</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>Type:</strong> Suspicious Transaction</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\"><strong>Score:</strong> 85/100</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Assign To</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\"><option>Select Investigator...</option><option>John Analyst</option><option>Sarah Investigator</option></select></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "Response & Notification",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Success (All)** → Green notification: \"Successfully assigned X alerts\"\n• **Partial Success** → Yellow notification dengan detail:\n  - Count success & failed\n  - List failed alert IDs\n  - Reason failure per ID\n• **Failed (All)** → Red notification: \"Failed to assign X alerts\"\n• **Cancel Mode** → Gray button untuk exit bulk assign mode\n• After submit, page auto-refresh dan back to normal mode",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;\">Success</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#166534;margin-top:1px;\">Successfully assigned 5 alerts</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Partial Success</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#92400e;margin-top:1px;\">3 assigned, 2 failed. IDs: 12345, 12347</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M15 9l-6 6M9 9l6 6\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">Failed</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#991b1b;margin-top:1px;\">Failed to assign 5 alerts</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
